Third-party files in this directory, compiled into renox-editors and served
by the apps that use it. Each is kept as published (no build step); the
licences are in licenses/.

trix-2.1.19.min.js, trix-2.1.19.css
  Trix 2.1.19, the rich text editor, by 37signals. MIT licence
  (licenses/trix-LICENSE).
  Source: https://registry.npmjs.org/trix/-/trix-2.1.19.tgz
  (dist/trix.umd.min.js and dist/trix.css). Change: the last line,
  "//# sourceMappingURL=trix.umd.min.js.map", is removed (the map isn't
  shipped).
  Trix bundles DOMPurify 3.4.2 (Cure53), "Apache-2.0 OR MPL-2.0"; used here
  under Apache-2.0 (licenses/dompurify-LICENSE).

prism-1.30.0.min.js
  Prism 1.30.0, syntax highlighting, by Lea Verou and contributors. MIT
  licence (licenses/prism-LICENSE).
  Source: https://registry.npmjs.org/prismjs/-/prismjs-1.30.0.tgz,
  components/prism-{core,markup,css,clike,javascript,typescript,json,rust,
  sql,bash,python,yaml,toml,markdown,diff,go}.min.js joined in that order,
  after a first line that sets Prism's manual mode (renox-editors starts the
  highlighting itself).

codejar-4.3.0.js
  CodeJar 4.3.0, the code editor, by Anton Medvedev. MIT licence
  (licenses/codejar-LICENSE).
  Source: https://registry.npmjs.org/codejar/-/codejar-4.3.0.tgz
  (dist/codejar.js), unchanged.

The toolbar icons in views/editors.html are drawn after Lucide's
(https://lucide.dev, ISC licence).
